epsaite on Sketchfab\n* Door Metal - https://skfb.ly/oPMxB by Mehdi Shahsavan on Sketchfab\n* Office Chair - https://skfb.ly/6VLRV by kreems on Sketchfab\n* Secretary - https://skfb.ly/orSJE by Tiago Lopes on Sketchfab\n\n### Music\n\n*   Universfield - https://pixabay.com/users/universfield-28281460/ from Pixabay\n", "short_description": "A psychological horror  game in hauntingly empty spaces where reality bends and you're never quite alone."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/e01e5f90-335b-4b60-a687-99e395218c39", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ximula", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ximu.la/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "10051244661625288"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2046062535885856"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2046062535885856"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1750083780, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2046062535885856"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "10051318781617876", "version": "ID.999"}, "id": "588176330554391", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "